README – Experiment 1
Employee Information Analysis using Python
Objective

The objective of this experiment is to perform Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) on an employee dataset using Python. The experiment analyzes employee information such as salary, department, gender, age, and experience, and visualizes the results using graphs.

